    {
      "source": "Creates <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a> based on <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a> to add LDAP-specific extensions. Typically,\nadds a <a href=\"QuerydslLdapPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.ldap.repository.support\"><code>QuerydslLdapPredicateExecutor</code></a> if the repository interface uses Querydsl.",
      "translation": "根据 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a> 创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a>，以添加 LDAP 特定的扩展。通常情况下，如果存储库接口使用了 Querydsl，则会添加一个 <a href=\"QuerydslLdapPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.ldap.repository.support\"><code>QuerydslLdapPredicateExecutor</code></a>。",
